<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending June 27 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS------RANGE--------PVS</p>
<p>THURSDAY, June 26</p>
<p>Asda Group Plc     F   PFT	   348.9	  344.0-355.0   304.6</p>
<p>			     DIV	     3.0	    2.8-3.1	2.65</p>
<p>			     EPS	     8.6	    8.3-8.7	 7.7</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 345.0 DIV 3.0 EPS 8.6)</p>
<p>Berkeley Group Plc F   PFT	    63.5	   57.5-68.4     43.4</p>
<p>			     DIV	     9.3	    9.2-9.5	 8.5</p>
<p>			     EPS	    44.3	   40.0-47.4     34.8</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 62.0 DIV 9.3 EPS 43.7)</p>
<p>BPB Plc		F   PFT	   162.0	  160.0-165.0   161.1</p>
<p>			     DIV	    10.3		10.3	  9.7</p>
<p>			     EPS	    20.8	   20.2-21.8     20.5</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 162.0 DIV 10.3 EPS 20.7)</p>
<p>GUS Plc		F   PFT	   556.3	  546.0-575.0   581.1</p>
<p>			     DIV	    18.1	   18.0-18.2     16.5</p>
<p>			     EPS	    36.5	   35.8-37.7     38.4</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 560.0 DIV 18.0 EPS 36.7)</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items</p>
<p>unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are</p>
<p>total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>* FRS3 accounting standard forecast</p>
<p>Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
